sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GW as Gateway / Caller
    participant H as HTTP Handler<br/>(http/handlers.go)
    participant MW as Middleware<br/>(BindPathTenant + Auth)
    participant SVC as EntitlementsService
    participant REPO as EntitlementRepository<br/>(postgres)
    participant CACHE as ValkeyCache
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    GW->>H: GET /api/v1/tenants/:id/effective-set
    H->>MW: BindPathTenant → set tenant_id in ctx
    MW->>H: ctx with tenant_id + auth claims
    H->>SVC: GetEffectiveSet(ctx, tenantID)

    SVC->>CACHE: Get(ent:tenant:{tenantID})
    alt cache hit
        CACHE-->>SVC: EffectiveSet (TTL 300s)
        SVC-->>H: EffectiveSet
    else cache miss
        CACHE-->>SVC: miss
        SVC->>REPO: GetLatestSnapshot(ctx, tenantID)
        REPO->>DB: SELECT … FROM entitlement_snapshots<br/>WHERE tenant_id=$1 (RLS enforced, GUC=tenantID)
        DB-->>REPO: EntitlementSnapshot row
        REPO-->>SVC: EntitlementSnapshot
        SVC->>SVC: computeEffectiveSet(snapshot, overrides, addons, trial)
        SVC->>CACHE: Set(ent:tenant:{tenantID}, effectiveSet, TTL=300s)
        SVC-->>H: EffectiveSet
    end
    H-->>GW: 200 OK { effective_set: … }

    Note over SVC,DB: ENT-INV-6 — recompute is a no-op when<br/>computed set equals latest snapshot<br/>(no write, no event emitted)
